{"4255920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "2mazing", "steam_appid": 4255920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to put your friendship - and rivalry - to the ultimate test?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friend awaken, disoriented and trapped within a maze. Only one exit exists, and it's guarded by the legendary <strong>Trophy of the Lost</strong>. This is not a journey of cooperation - it's a fast-paced race where every instinct, every shortcut, and every tactical move counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2mazing</strong> is a hyper-competitive 2-player local  co-op  game that transforms your friend into your greatest obstacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>To play, an additional controller is required.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Levels:</strong> Race through a huge campaign with 100 levels. The maps change in size, difficulty, and style, so every race feels fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Abilities:</strong> This is the main challenge - each level gives you and your opponent a new set of abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Head-to-Head Competition:</strong> The goal is simple: be the first to touch the coveted Trophy. The execution is anything but. Will you prioritize speed, or will you use your abilities to find the Trophy?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>True Replayability:</strong> The combination of varied and random maze layouts and the strategic use of abilities guarantees endless replay value and heated rematches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step inside the maze. The race is on. Only one of you can claim the prize.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to put your friendsh